      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This potion holds a tiny, tightly wrapped scroll and tastes like paper. Upon drinking it, you gain a burst of insight into your immediate future—and how to potentially avoid it. When you attempt a saving throw, you can roll twice and use the better result. The potion's magic ends when you make use of this effect, or after 1 minute. You then become immune to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bottled omen",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " potions for 24 hours."
          }
        ]
      },
